<title>UK: British troops kill Bosnia war crimes suspect.</title>
<headline>British troops kill Bosnia war crimes suspect.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British peacekeeping troops shot dead a war crimes suspect and arrested another during a gunbattle in northern Bosnia on Thursday, Foreign Secretary Robin Cook said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a gun battle in which one British soldier was slightly wounded. The suspect himself was killed,&quot; Cook said.</p>
</text>
